roget and rogetindex, which dict -d roget reads, are Roget's Thesaurus
of 1911, from Project Gutenberg's text (https://www.gutenberg.org/),
with dict's index. They carry neither Project Gutenberg's license nor
its name. MICRA, Inc., who made the text from the 1911 edition, makes
no proprietary claims on it.

p9web's scripts/dl.sh reads them by 9P from 9p.io's copy of Plan 9's
sources, extra/roget, and checks their SHA-256.

On Plan 9, to get them from sources use

	9fs sources
	cp /n/sources/extra/roget/* /lib/dict
